  "contracts": [
    "Image registrations include SQL/seed directories and shared archive verifier; physical pins retain the owner. Observers retain no files, stores or pins. Quarantine stays unavailable. Refund follows synced deletion; closed durable files are not inventoried.",
    "Incoming connections include TCP/TLS handshakes and per-lane real capacities, including sixteen reserved inspection slots once enabled. Outgoing counts include idle pools, inspection and seed/snapshot transfers until physical exit.",
    "Every host scans bounded batches under one cycle deadline. Only a complete ordered identity-matched population updates role/readiness/lag totals. Partial, overflow and failed cycles cannot refresh source age; population changes/activation invalidate views. Parked histories have unknown archive coverage.",
    "Controller bank/activity/counter snapshots carry source age and are unavailable when unconfigured or invalid. Attempt counts do not prove membership or election outcomes.",
    "One and 32 committed groups expose the same 110 samples; a configured controller adds thirteen. No cell/group/member/node identities enter labels. Scrapes perform no group enumeration, Raft calls, callbacks or I/O.",
    "JSON u64 image sizes, lag, controller counters and sample ages use decimal strings."
  ],
