      "source_revision": "37aed98b6aaa6d39f995a853aef1094991dc729b",
      "result": "unresolved parallel regression finding",
      "details": "With test-threads=4 and concurrent workspace Clippy, receiver callback count was 3 rather than 1 before intentional source leader shutdown; the test had observed published receiver value 9 with archive output held. This is not proof of three committed effects. One isolated Cargo replay, eight direct executable replays, and the complete serial CI-style matrix pass. Root cause remains unlocalized; no effect code, assertion, retry rule or deadline was changed. A passing replay does not erase the failure.",
      "output_section": "tests"
    },
    {
      "case": "development incoming control connection capacity",
      "result": "fixed",
      "details": "An unpinned intermediate exporter subtracted available inspection-expanded semaphore permits from the ordinary lane capacity and panicked. Source revision records actual lane capacities, serializes expansion/capture through the registry lock, uses checked arithmetic, and covers granted inspection capacity plus held/cancelled handshakes. The red development output has no qualified source pin.",
      "artifact": "MR-13-resource-views-control-capacity-red.log.gz"
    },
